<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">FILEMON</para>
  <para style="toc1">Philemon</para>
  <para style="toc2">FILEMON</para>
  <para style="toc3">Flm</para>
  <para style="mt">FILEMON</para>
  <para style="mt2">KALAN LOCCEIHTU PAUL CCAKY</para>
  <para style="mt2">Philemon</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Filemon</char> hynh doliakupaw Khriccaaw lu kheit thua zah, Onesimas ci hae paw a bawipaw ryte Kolose Khriccaawbuu lungkhu e nynh athua cih paw alo. Paul thong a ccaw lyaze a la tungkuh hae paw te a bawipaw kyate yn ccuepaw see nynh thua. Paul liate Onesimas tuh Khriccaaw lang yn tang. <char style="bk">Filemon kalan Paul Ccaky</char> hynh Filemon kalan Paul nynh bua a sawpaw a seepaw te ccawkuthuinaw ngia zah ngaethyapaw see kyalya lante thua leite Khriccaaw uno lu kheit lante a lehkhan nawlan a ngianawpaw ccaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alungkhu Umpaw</para>
  <para style="io1">Byalaanmaw — 1-3</para>
  <para style="io1">Filemon thehoysahnaw — 4-7</para>
  <para style="io1">Onesimas hanlan ngiapyanaw — 8-22</para>
  <para style="io1">Athangnaw — 23-25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beihlangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu Khri keiccu thong a ccahpaw Paul te kae unopaw Timote nynh kae sungsahpaw te rya kae lahkheihpaw Filemon kalan, <verse number="2" style="v" />kae sungsahpaw Apfia te rhawkaw kae tangkheihpaw Arkhippas kalan te na inn kya a pumkuh hae paw khriccaawbuu kalan ccaw kae ky oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:17">Kol 4.17</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ah Paaw Pachia te Bawipaw Jesu Khri kya-e thawccinaw te daenaw tuh nae kya la um sah.</para>
  <para style="s1">Filemon Ozia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka sawsangnaw kya nang kha kae lia takyhte, ka Pachia kalan lungtuabya zungzae ka ho. <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccecize Bawipaw Jesu Khri na zynnaw te mithyaa hae balyn na sungsahnaw hae kha ka thae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Khri hanlan aening kya umpaw ahoypaw uccaw miakaw kha nynaw liate na zynnaw na neethung hae paw tuh ccungkiapaw lang a tang nawlan saw kae sang. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka sungsahpaw ka neitaw, na hoipaw sungsakunaw nynh lungtuanaw te thawzung patae yn pya, pawccecize nang nynh mithyaa hae kha mih lung na tuasah hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Onesimas hanlan Ngiapyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kawpya lan accanpaw kha Khri liate rawhoyte kae pya ngan zemah, <verse number="9" style="v" />a kum mah tang vae zah atu lya Khri Jesu keiccu thong mah a ccahpaw kae, Paul nynh sungsakunaw keiccu ngiate kae ngia paleih. <verse number="10" style="v" />Thong yn sawnaw hae kya ka saahkupaw ka ccapaw Onesimas hanlan nang kha kae ngia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:9">Kol 4.9</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Langmawlya aning tuh na hanlan ccungkia khyh, thuasalama atu tuh na hanlan te ka hanlan ccungkia vae, <verse number="12" style="v" />amaw kha na kalan bua kae saw, tukeiccuze amaw kha leh la khan; tuh-e tuh kamaw ka thinlung kya-e nynh thua. <verse number="13" style="v" />Thehoypaw keiccuze thong ka ccaw lungkhu aning nynh namaw ccelang rya yn lawpya nawlan amaw kha ka kya ka umsah rypaw nynh thua. <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama na nawccawpaw tuh nangse keiccu thua leite, lungthote na cyipaw kha ka ryhua, na nawccaw leite pawsang ka cyih ry khyh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Aning nynh na kyate sosoh a la toikupaw tuh amaw kha zungzae na hoi nawlan athua khopaw nynh thua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Atu tuh see lu kheit hawte thua vae leite, see lae ahang lante la ccou ccavae, abyapi lante kamaw hanlan sungsahpaw uno nynh athua vae; pynsaw lante thuasah, Bawipaw kya thuasah na hanlan pawcihmou houh sungsahpaw thua lan accan.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kae hynh ah mungkuhpaw lu kheit lante nae tua ze, amaw hynh kamaw hawte la ccou. <verse number="18" style="v" />Na tungvaw a cyisei ze, tuhkhyhze hankhakheit laebah ae um ze, tuh-e tuh kae nynh laebah ka umpaw lante la tua. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuh-e laebah tuh kae pyaru cih cite hynh-e hynh kae, Paul nynh kamaw ka kuih te ka zeipaw nynh thua. Tuhzemah namaw na hiinnaw heize ka kya laebah na um cipaw kae hopah khyh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Athua, ka neitaw, na kyate thanenaw kha Bawipaw kya mue ka ry, Bawipaw min te nang nynh ka lung yn tuasah. <verse number="21" style="v" />Nang nynh kaw na la ngae cih cite zynkunaw ka hoi zah, e ccaw hynh na kalan kae zei, ka hopaw lae heize na la cyih cih cite ka zyn.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka thuanaw lanpaw hmin kha mah yn la paccynpah; pawccecize nae sawsangnaw liate nae kalan thuanaw kaw ka mue cih cite ka ngaehoi.</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyathya Beihlangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khri Jesu kya kamaw ryte thong kae ccahkheihpaw Epafras nynh nang kha ae beihlang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:7">Kol 1.7</ref>, <ref loc="COL 4:12">4.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />Kamaw ryte rya kae lahkheih hae paw Marka, Aristarkhas, Demas te Luka nynh ae beihlang hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Loc 12.12</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13.13</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15.37-39</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 19:29">19.29</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27.2</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Kol 4.10</ref>, <ref loc="COL 4:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:10">2Ti 4.10</ref>, <ref loc="2TI 4:11">11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri kya-e thawccinaw tuh nae muisaw kya la um vae sah. Amen.</para>
</usx>